                <pb facs="0809" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg721"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick reports that the viceroy, for considerations pertaining to the
                    war, declines to grant the request for the return to Japan of the crew of the
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Hagino Ura Maru.</hi>)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
